SCOPE OF THE PUBLIC DOMAIN DEDICATION

The dedication in UNLICENSE covers the original code and assets in this
component. The ten armour pieces, their textures, their worn atlases and their
GeckoLib geometry were drawn for this mod. They are new work that takes its cue
from the sets they finish; no upstream art is copied or derived.

It does not, and cannot, cover third-party material that this component merely
depends on or interoperates with. Six sets are completed here and each belongs
to its own mod, which keeps its own licence and whose own assets stay in its own
jar:

- Spiny Shell - Born in Chaos (Mongoose_artist)
- Bone Reptile - L_Ender's Cataclysm (L_Ender)
- Bishop of Deceit, Pyromancer Brute, Nameless One, Necromancer - Haze n Stuff
  (Hazen)

The armour framework, the renderers and the animation the pieces attach to come
from Iron's Spells n Spellbooks and GeckoLib. Nothing from any of them is
redistributed here.

Textures that finish a set are written into that set's own namespace, because
that is where its renderer looks for them. The files are ours; the namespace is
only an address.

Compile-time dependencies are resolved from public mavens at build time. No
third-party jar is committed.
